sdi-sentence--end-pos 4#/4 294 53236 978 30 ;.
sdi-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#295
|  Meanwhile,
|  syntactically, that compositional motif is cued by the left-adjacency of
|  red before box, which in English binds
.  adjectives to nominal targets
sdi-sentence-text $# 295 ;.

sdi-new-sentence 4# 295 ;.
sdi-sentence-switch-pos 4#/4 295 53237 978 31 ;.
sdi-sentence--end-pos 4#/4 295 53345 980 38 ;.
sdi-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#296
|  Thus we have a
|  syntactic operation/relation (left-adjacency) and a
.  semantic operation (set-intersection)
sdi-sentence-text $# 296 ;.

sdi-new-sentence 4# 296 ;.
sdi-sentence-switch-pos 4#/4 296 53346 980 39 ;.
sdi-sentence--end-pos 4#/4 296 53575 984 30 ;.
sdi-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#297
|  The gist
|  of [/Bolt/] is that mapping the phrase to its signification
|  depends not just on mapping the two words but also
|  mapping the intra-Category morphisms to each other (adjacency
.  projects to set-intersection)
sdi-sentence-text $# 297 ;.
sdi-sentence-end-pos 4#/4 296 53576 984 31 ;.

sdi-new-sentence 4# 297 ;.
sdi-sentence-start-pos 4#/4 297 53578 986 1 ;.
